# 07_aggregate_multiseed.py 依赖它们，新克隆无需重训即可复现 multiseed_report.json。
!reports/encoder_metrics_s42.json
!reports/encoder_metrics_s43.json
!reports/encoder_metrics_s44.json
!reports/qwen_lora_metrics_s42.json
!reports/qwen_lora_metrics_s43.json
!reports/qwen_lora_metrics_s44.json
!reports/rules_metrics_s42.json
!reports/rules_metrics_s43.json
!reports/rules_metrics_s44.json
